## Why This Is Asked
This task tests end-to-end capabilities for complex, multi-tenant data flows, cross-service parity, and auditability under concurrency.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant data isolation
- Background reconciliation jobs
- Cross-service consistency checks
- Feature flag variability
- Concurrency and race conditions
- Audit logs and retention

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-test asserting per-tenant SOT parity
const tenants = seedTenants(100);
for (const t of tenants) {
  const hashA = hash(fetch(t, 'Contacts'));
  const hashB = hash(fetch(t, 'Activities'));
  const hashC = hash(fetch(t, 'Deals'));
  assert(hashA === hashB && hashB === hashC, `Pariy fail for ${t.id}`);
}
```

